[{"answer":"There is always housework to do when you live in a house.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/1.mp3"},{"answer":"You have to wash the windows so that you can see outside.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/2.mp3"},{"answer":"The floors and the carpets need to be vacuumed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/3.mp3"},{"answer":"The floors also need to be washed,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/4.mp3"},{"answer":"and some of them need to be waxed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/5.mp3"},{"answer":"The furniture has to be polished.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/6.mp3"},{"answer":"The bathroom has to be kept clean.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/7.mp3"},{"answer":"After you have a bath,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/8.mp3"},{"answer":"you need to clean out the bathtub.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Laundry needs to be done regularly,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/10.mp3"},{"answer":"or you will run out of clothes to wear.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/11.mp3"},{"answer":"The clothes go into the washing machine,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/12.mp3"},{"answer":"and then they have to be dried in the dryer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes, we hang the clothes out on the line to be dried.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Some of the clothes need to be ironed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/15.mp3"},{"answer":"You have to buy groceries and put them away.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Meals need to be made.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/17.mp3"},{"answer":"You can't let the dishes pile up in the kitchen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/18.mp3"},{"answer":"The dishes have to be washed,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/19.mp3"},{"answer":"and the counters need to be wiped.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/20.mp3"},{"answer":"The stove needs to be cleaned,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/21.mp3"},{"answer":"and sometimes the refrigerator and the cupboards need to be cleaned out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/22.mp3"},{"answer":"You can dust the furniture and sweep up the dirt.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/23.mp3"},{"answer":"You can make the beds.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/24.mp3"},{"answer":"The beds have to be changed too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/25.mp3"},{"answer":"They need to have clean sheets put on them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/26.mp3"},{"answer":"There are just so many things to do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Household chores take up a lot of time","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/19-housework-2019-03-20-08-38-08/28.mp3"}]
